00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,757
True that, it may be our
only viable prospect.

249
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,500
Yeah, given the situation.

250
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,260
A spy is our only hope.

251
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:36,540
Please, I'm begging you.

252
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,252
That's not gonna happen.

253
00:14:38,740 --> 00:14:41,152
This is a test of your dignity as a maid.

254
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:45,917
Every one of you maids must do what
you should as members of Maid Alien.

255
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,857
Wubwub Moonbeam was viciously
ravaged by the creatures.

256
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:50,517
Time to kill the guilty pigs.

257
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:54,317
We will prove our superior
prowess to the universe and use

258
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:57,237
this opportunity to exterminate
all creatures from Akiba.

259
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:59,320
The war for our world is imminent.

260
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:08,641
Hello, Mistress.

261
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,237
We have a starfruit event
going on this month.

262
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,437
Ooh, that's yummy.

263
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:17,037
We're having a top shot pork
chop dance that sounds lovely.

264
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,917
Um. Hey.

265
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,177
Do you want to come visit?

266
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:22,097
Our cafe. Oh.

267
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:25,097
Are you okay? So. Sorry.

268
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:26,217
I'm fine.

269
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,757
Here.

270
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,977
Uh. Yeah. Right.

271
00:15:30,060 --> 00:15:32,660
Thanks for helping me pick them up.

272
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:47,022
You mean for real, they're
actually after us now?

273
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:50,797
So they're planning to crush us
to trigger an all-out war, huh?

274
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:52,300
This is valuable info.

275
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:55,137
If not for this note, we
would have been sitting ducks.

276
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:56,050
Totally awesome.

277
00:15:56,133 --> 00:15:56,963
This is great.

278
00:15:57,046 --> 00:15:59,000
We should thank the spy. Nagomi!

279
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:01,027
Thank you, dutiful daughter!

280
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,395
I didn't do anything!

281
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:04,360
Oh, okay. Never mind then.

282
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:05,461
Let's get ready.

283
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:08,760
Miss Manami, the cops are here. Huh?

284
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:15,060
I heard you got a new acting head, so I
figured I should drop by and say hello.

285
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:20,942
Oh, by the way, I hear you're going to have
a romp with Creatureland sometime soon.

286
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:24,137
I don't think I know what
you mean by all that.

287
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:26,161
Well, we got tipped off, you see.

288
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:29,377
It's just we police have
to investigate these

289
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,917
things or we meet the
wrath of the citizens.

290
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,857
But it really looks like made aliens
doing rather well, aren't they?

291
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:36,770
Officer,

292
00:16:36,853 --> 00:16:38,597
I just came back to
town and can't tell the

293
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:41,327
Shower Dory exit from
the Electric Town exit.

294
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,460
I do hope we can rely on you for guidance.

295
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:03,457
That's good money down the drain
where'd that leak come from?

296
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:05,857
Go find that goddamn squealing rat!

297
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:10,777
Right by the way, apparently the police
rep made alien headquarters the other day?

298
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:13,037
So wait does Does that
mean we're safe to stroll?

299
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,477
We cannot let our guard down.

300
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,837
We should be on high alert for a while.

301
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:19,277
So make sure you don't go anywhere alone.

302
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:24,066
I haven't been able to reach Nerula since
she handed me that note the other day.

303
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,440
I'm sure she's fine.

304
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,457
She's a tough kid, so don't worry.

305
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:29,246
I can tell that about people.

306
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:33,057
Nagomi, do you wish to go
out and search for Nerula?

307
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:35,120
I want to do what I can for her.

308
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:38,417
Then I shall accompany you on
your strolls starting tomorrow.

309
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:39,330
Huh?

310
00:17:39,413 --> 00:17:41,197
The oinky-doink is being
targeted right now,

311
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:43,868
so we need to make sure
we are on our guard.

312
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:44,830
Thank you.

313
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:49,284
Pretty certain this is the one.

314
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,500
Gotta erase her then.

315
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,327
We're tracking her down now.

316
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:02,720
No sign of Nerula on
the street today either.

317
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:05,357
Have you been able to sleep at all lately?

318
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,000
No, I'm too worried.

319
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,940
She's alive. What?

320
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:10,533
I said the kid's alive.

321
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,525
Have you seen Nerula recently?

322
00:18:12,860 --> 00:18:13,690
Yeah.

323
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:14,970
Well, tell us!

324
00:18:15,053 --> 00:18:15,883
Where was she?

325
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,390
Nerula!

326
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:29,320
Why are you here, Nogomi?

327
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:33,040
I'm so glad you're okay.

328
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:36,880
I'm so sorry I caused you to worry.

329
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:42,238
They're looking for me
because I betrayed Maid Alien.

330
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,720
Because of me?

331
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:46,390
No.

332
00:18:46,473 --> 00:18:47,400
Because I wanted to.

333
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:51,524
I'm glad I got to see you
one last time, Nogomi.

334
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,720
One last time?

335
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:55,567
I'm going to stick by
my own Maid principles.

336
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,840
What do we have here?

337
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,117
What are you doing?

338
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,729
Conspiring with the swine?

339
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,937
Just making small talk.

340
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:09,897
You know what you've gone and done,
getting in the way of us crushing the pigs?

341
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:13,274
That traitorous mouth of yours
needs permanent shutting.

342
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,880
And I would do it again.

343
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,230
No, Gomi.

344
00:19:16,313 --> 00:19:17,143
We should go now.

345
00:19:17,226 --> 00:19:18,056
What do you mean, do it again?

346
00:19:18,139 --> 00:19:19,797
This is between me and the made aliens.

347
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:20,957
You two should leave.

348
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:23,877
You're the quiet one I met
at the old ramen joint.

349
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,040
That's too bad.

350
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,417
And here I thought we
were gonna be friends.

351
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:29,206
Yeah, it's a shame, isn't it?

352
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:31,397
I suppose it was meant to be, though.

353
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:35,421
I'll crush your face along with
the rest of you creature land pigs.

354
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:44,977
Why you you sure are brave you know
who you're pointing that blade at?

355
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:48,737
Yeah crimson supernova prepare to die!

356
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:53,800
Oh look at you trying to be
bad this better be worth it?

357
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,960
Miyabi, stay out of this!

358
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:07,280
Better loosen that grip there, brave one.

359
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:13,560
Nerula! Stay back!

360
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,760
Time to die.

361
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:24,320
Now you're just starting to annoy me.

362
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:26,720
Bronco, you've got to go help her!

363
00:20:26,940 --> 00:20:28,160
This is their issue.

364
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:30,557
But if we don't do
anything, Nerula will...

365
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:32,437
That's what it means to be an Akiba maid.

366
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:34,797
Nerula knew just what she
was getting herself into.

367
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:36,577
Who cares about all that maid crap?

368
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:38,020
Nerula is my sister!

369
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:42,011
Those words are all I ever needed to hear.

370
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:53,980
Traitors only have one place to
go, and that's straight to hell.

371
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:57,690
No!

372
00:20:57,773 --> 00:20:58,603
No! No!

373
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,270
No!

374
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:01,790
No!

375
00:21:03,180 --> 00:21:05,840
No! No! No! No! No!

376
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:11,350
No!

377
00:21:11,433 --> 00:21:16,620
No way! Please, no!

378
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:20,495
Harming one of ours goes
against the code, does it not?

379
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:24,180
Put that thing down.

380
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:29,260
All you do is cry without doing
shit, and you call yourself a maid?

381
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,640
Miss Minami, the cops are on their way.

382
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:35,800
Sounds like we're done here.

383
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:39,420
Now don't forget, pigs, our
war is just getting started.

384
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,880
What do I do?

385
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:45,355
The blood won't stop!

386
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:46,830
Let go of me.

387
00:21:48,780 --> 00:21:52,260
I'm so sorry I dragged you into this.

388
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:54,240
No, no, you're wrong!

389
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,380
It was me!

390
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:01,917
I wish I could have lived
a little bit longer.

391
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,500
Sister, sister,

392
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:09,537
you won't ever change

393
00:22:09,620 --> 00:22:12,820
the way you truly are.

394
00:22:15,560 --> 00:22:18,800
Be the maid you are now.

395
00:22:21,060 --> 00:22:21,890
No!

396
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:40,220
Thank you.

397
00:23:05,820 --> 00:23:06,650
Ah, yeah,

398
00:23:06,733 --> 00:23:08,257
yeah, yeah, yeah,

399
00:23:08,340 --> 00:23:15,340
yeah.

400
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:35,040
Thank you so much for joining us today.
